n.\n- CLAUDE.md (next to this file) mirrors these instructions.\n\n\n## CLAUDE.md (embedded)\n\n# 2.3 sub agent — CLAUDE.md\n\nMirror of AGENTS.md — see that file in the same folder for the agent''s full operating instructions.\n\n## Identity\n\n- **Agent ID**: 137\n- **Workspace**: WORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_137\n\n## Quick reference\n\n- Workspace: `WORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_137`\n- User uploads (knowledge): `upload/`; deliverables: `generated/`; scratch/misc: `other/`; skills: `skills/`.\n- After producing a deliverable, summarize what you created and where it was saved.", "tools": [], "native_tools": ["task", "think_tool", "reasoning_chain", "write_todos", "read_todos", "web_search", "web_fetch", "rename_file", "move_file", "mkdir", "bash", "skill", "save_document", "memory_store", "memory_recall", "pg_list_tables", "pg_describe_table", "pg_query", "pg_list_agents", "pg_get_agent", "pg_list_projects", "sqlite_execute", "sqlite_load_csv", "python_execute", "save_analysis_result", "graphindex_search", "graphindex_load", "doc_index_list", "tavily_search"], "cli_tools": [], "custom_tools": [], "use_deepagents": false, "use_phase9_graphindex": false, "enable_compiled_subagents": true, "use_local_sandbox": false, "middleware": [], "subagents": [{"name": "research-agent", "description": "Delegate research tasks to the sub-agent researcher. Only give this researcher one topic at a time.", "type": "dictionary", "model": "minimax-m3", "system_prompt": "You are a researcher. Research the topic provided to you. \nImportant: make a single call to the web_search tool and use the result provided by the tool to answer the provided topic.", "tools": ["web_search", "tavily_search"], "middleware": [], "workflow_id": null, "workflow_config": null}], "backend": {"type": "state", "config": {}, "mappings": null}, "guardrails": {"interrupts": {}, "token_limits": {"max_total_tokens": 100000, "eviction_threshold": 80000, "summarization_threshold": 60000}, "enable_auto_eviction": true,