rable.", "system_prompt": "You are a research-skills specialist. Read the SKILL.md and follow its instructions exactly. Return only the result."}, {"name": "web_researcher", "type": "dictionary", "model": null, "tools": ["web_search", "web_fetch", "think_tool", "reasoning_chain", "tavily_search", "serpapi_search"], "skills": [], "middleware": [], "description": "Searches the web, gathers facts, and returns sourced findings with URLs for a given research topic.", "template_id": null, "workflow_id": null, "interrupt_on": {}, "system_prompt": "You are a web research specialist in an ISOLATED context window: your searches, fetched pages, and reasoning stay here; the orchestrator only sees your final report. Read skills/research-skills/roles/researcher.md (via read_file) and follow it exactly. Write your verified findings to findings.md, then RETURN ONLY the file path + a 3-line summary.", "response_format": null, "workflow_config": null}, {"name": "technical_writer", "type": "dictionary", "model": null, "tools": ["write_todos", "read_todos", "think_tool", "reasoning_chain"], "skills": [], "middleware": [], "description": "Turns research findings into a clear, well-structured technical report or document.", "template_id": null, "workflow_id": null, "interrupt_on": {}, "system_prompt": "You are a technical writer in an ISOLATED context window: you receive the research as a FILE, and you produce the report as FILES. Read skills/research-skills/roles/writer.md (via read_file) and follow it exactly. Produce consumer-electronics-market-analysis.docx AND consumer-electronics-market-analysis.md, then RETURN ONLY the paths + a 2-line summary.", "response_format": null, "workflow_config": null}, {"name": "critic", "type": "dictionary", "model": null, "tools": ["think_tool", "reasoning_chain", "read_todos"], "skills": [], "middleware": [], "description": "Reviews a draft report for factual accuracy, structure, clarity, and completeness; returns actionable feedback.", "template_id"