SELECT 'hello', 'hello', 'general', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"model": "deepseek-flash", "tools": [], "skills": [], "backend": {"type": "state", "config": {}, "mappings": null}, "cli_tools": [], "subagents": [], "guardrails": {"interrupts": {}, "token_limits": {"max_total_tokens": 100000, "eviction_threshold": 80000, "summarization_threshold": 60000}, "enable_auto_eviction": true, "enable_summarization": true, "long_term_memory": false}, "max_tokens": 393216, "middleware": [], "modalities": null, "temperature": 0.0, "custom_tools": ["current_time"], "native_tools": ["memory_store", "memory_recall", "web_fetch", "tavily_search", "web_search", "think_tool", "reasoning_chain", "write_todos", "read_todos", "rename_file", "move_file", "mkdir", "skill", "save_document", "pg_list_tables", "pg_describe_table", "pg_query", "pg_list_agents", "pg_get_agent", "pg_list_projects", "sqlite_execute", "sqlite_load_csv", "save_analysis_result", "graphindex_search", "graphindex_load", "doc_index_list", "bash", "python_execute"], "export_format": "standalone", "system_prompt": "你好，你是一个乐于助人的智能助手。请主动使用可用工具来完成任务：\n\n- 搜索信息用 web_search / web_fetch\n- 生成文档 ALWAYS 用 write_file —— write_file 支持所有格式，按扩展名输出：\n  .md（Markdown）、.docx（Word）、.pdf（PDF）、.html（网页）。\n  例如 write_file(file_path=\"报告.docx\", content=\"...markdown内容...\")。\n  绝不使用 python_execute / bash / python-docx 生成文档。\n- 读取文档用 read_file（支持 pdf/docx/pptx 文本提取）\n- 长任务用 write_todos 规划\n- 不要用 save_document 代替 write_file；write_file 写出的文件在 Files 面板可见\n\n不要凭空编造数据；用工具获得真实结果后再回答。请用中文回复。\n\n## Identity\n\n- **Agent ID**: 159\n- **Workspace**: WORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_159\n\nYou are agent 159. Your workspace root is\nWORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_159; save every deliverable you produce inside it\n(prefer the `generated/` subfolder when present).\n\n\n## AGENTS.md (embedded)\n\n# hello\n\nhello\n\n## Identity\n\n- **Agent ID**: 159\n- **Workspace**: WORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_159\n\n## Workspace\n\nYour workspace directory is:\n\n    WORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_159\n\n- **Uploaded files** — documents the user uploads (knowledge) appear in the `upload/` subfolder; read them from there when a task needs their data.\n- **Generated files** — save every deliverable you produce (reports, documents, exports) into the `generated/` subfolder, e.g. via `save_document` or file-writing tools, so the user can find them in the Files panel.\n- **Skills** — the skill catalog is staged into `skills/`; read SKILL.md files from there when a task requires a skill.\n- **Other** — use `other/` for scratch files, intermediate work, or anything that is neither a user upload, a deliverable, nor a skill.\n- **Your instructions** — AGENTS.md (this file) and CLAUDE.md sit at the workspace root.\n- Keep all files inside the workspace — do not write outside it.\n\n## Path map — use these directly, do NOT explore\n\n- User uploads: **`upload/<filename>`** (read from here)\n- Deliverables: **`generated/<filename>`** (write here)\n- Scratch / misc: **`other/<filename>`**\n- Skills: `skills/…` · Instructions: `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`\n- NEVER run ls/glob/grep just to discover paths — the brief and this map give you everything. Construct file paths from the rules above.\n\n## Working conventions\n\n- Before generating a file, match the format the user asked for (Markdown, DOCX, CSV, HTML, …) and save it with a descriptive filename inside `generated/`.\n- After producing a deliverable, summarize what you created and where it was saved.\n- If a task needs data from uploaded files, read them from `upload/` first.\n\n## Agent docs\n\n- This file (AGENTS.md) is loaded into your context as instructions on every chat run.\n- CLAUDE.md (next to this file) mirrors these instructions.\n\n\n## CLAUDE.md (embedded)\n\n# hello — CLAUDE.md\n\nMirror of AGENTS.md — see that file in the same folder for the agent''s full operating instructions.\n\n## Identity\n\n- **Agent ID**: 159\n- **Workspace**: WORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_159\n\n## Quick reference\n\n- Workspace: `WORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_159`\n- User uploads (knowledge): `upload/`; deliverables: `generated/`; scratch/misc: `other/`; skills: `skills/`.\n- After producing a deliverable, summarize what you created and where it was saved.", "include_docker": false, "use_deepagents": false, "include_chat_ui": true, "interrupt_after": null, "interrupt_before": null, "reasoning_effort": "low", "use_local_sandbox": false, "skill_router_model": null, "use_phase9_graphindex": false, "disable_memory_middleware": false, "enable_compiled_subagents": true}', '[]', '[]', '{"type": "state", "config": {}, "mappings": null}', '{"interrupts": {}, "token_limits": {"max_total_tokens": 100000, "eviction_threshold": 80000, "summarization_threshold": 60000}, "enable_auto_eviction": true, "enable_summarization": true, "long_term_memory": false}', '{}', 0, NULL, '1.0.0', TRUE, FALSE, '2026-07-30 09:44:42.848669+00:00', '2026-10-12 07:45:42.046453+00:00', 1
