SELECT 'identity-check-agent', 'Agent to verify identity injection', 'general', NULL, NULL, '{"AGENTS.md": "# identity-check-agent\n\nAgent to verify identity injection\n\n## Identity\n\n- **Agent ID**: 186\n- **Workspace**: WORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_186\n\n## Workspace\n\nYour workspace directory is:\n\n    WORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_186\n\n- **Uploaded files** — documents the user uploads (knowledge) appear in the `upload/` subfolder; read them from there when a task needs their data.\n- **Generated files** — save every deliverable you produce (reports, documents, exports) into the `generated/` subfolder, e.g. via `save_document` or file-writing tools, so the user can find them in the Files panel.\n- **Skills** — the skill catalog is staged into `skills/`; read SKILL.md files from there when a task requires a skill.\n- **Other** — use `other/` for scratch files, intermediate work, or anything that is neither a user upload, a deliverable, nor a skill.\n- **Your instructions** — AGENTS.md (this file) and CLAUDE.md sit at the workspace root.\n- Keep all files inside the workspace — do not write outside it.\n\n## Path map — use these directly, do NOT explore\n\n- User uploads: **`upload/<filename>`** (read from here)\n- Deliverables: **`generated/<filename>`** (write here)\n- Scratch / misc: **`other/<filename>`**\n- Skills: `skills/…` · Instructions: `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`\n- NEVER run ls/glob/grep just to discover paths — the brief and this map give you everything. Construct file paths from the rules above.\n\n## Working conventions\n\n- Before generating a file, match the format the user asked for (Markdown, DOCX, CSV, HTML, …) and save it with a descriptive filename inside `generated/`.\n- After producing a deliverable, summarize what you created and where it was saved.\n- If a task needs data from uploaded files, read them from `upload/` first.\n\n## Agent docs\n\n- This file (AGENTS.md) is loaded into your context as instructions on every chat run.\n- CLAUDE.md (next to this file) mirrors these instructions.\n", "CLAUDE.md": "# identity-check-agent — CLAUDE.md\n\nMirror of AGENTS.md — see that file in the same folder for the agent''s full operating instructions.\n\n## Identity\n\n- **Agent ID**: 186\n- **Workspace**: WORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_186\n\n## Quick reference\n\n- Workspace: `WORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_186`\n- User uploads (knowledge): `upload/`; deliverables: `generated/`; scratch/misc: `other/`; skills: `skills/`.\n- After producing a deliverable, summarize what you created and where it was saved.\n"}', '{"model": "deepseek-flash", "tools": [], "skills": [], "backend": {"type": "state", "config": {}, "mappings": null}, "plugins": [], "cli_tools": [], "subagents": [], "guardrails": {"interrupts": {}, "token_limits": {"max_total_tokens": 100000, "eviction_threshold": 80000, "summarization_threshold": 60000}, "long_term_memory": false, "enable_auto_eviction": true, "enable_summarization": true}, "max_tokens": null, "middleware": [], "modalities": null, "temperature": 0.7, "custom_tools": [], "native_tools": ["web_search", "write_file", "read_file"], "export_format": "standalone", "system_prompt": "You are a helpful assistant. Use tools when needed.\n\n## Identity\n\n- **Agent ID**: 186\n- **Workspace**: WORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_186\n\nYou are agent 186. Your workspace root is\nWORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_186; save every deliverable you produce inside it\n(prefer the `generated/` subfolder when present).\n\n\n## AGENTS.md (embedded)\n\n# identity-check-agent\n\nAgent to verify identity injection\n\n## Identity\n\n- **Agent ID**: 186\n- **Workspace**: WORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_186\n\n## Workspace\n\nYour workspace directory is:\n\n    WORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_186\n\n- **Uploaded files** — documents the user uploads (knowledge) appear in the `upload/` subfolder; read them from there when a task needs their data.\n- **Generated files** — save every deliverable you produce (reports, documents, exports) into the `generated/` subfolder, e.g. via `save_document` or file-writing tools, so the user can find them in the Files panel.\n- **Skills** — the skill catalog is staged into `skills/`; read SKILL.md files from there when a task requires a skill.\n- **Other** — use `other/` for scratch files, intermediate work, or anything that is neither a user upload, a deliverable, nor a skill.\n- **Your instructions** — AGENTS.md (this file) and CLAUDE.md sit at the workspace root.\n- Keep all files inside the workspace — do not write outside it.\n\n## Path map — use these directly, do NOT explore\n\n- User uploads: **`upload/<filename>`** (read from here)\n- Deliverables: **`generated/<filename>`** (write here)\n- Scratch / misc: **`other/<filename>`**\n- Skills: `skills/…` · Instructions: `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`\n- NEVER run ls/glob/grep just to discover paths — the brief and this map give you everything. Construct file paths from the rules above.\n\n## Working conventions\n\n- Before generating a file, match the format the user asked for (Markdown, DOCX, CSV, HTML, …) and save it with a descriptive filename inside `generated/`.\n- After producing a deliverable, summarize what you created and where it was saved.\n- If a task needs data from uploaded files, read them from `upload/` first.\n\n## Agent docs\n\n- This file (AGENTS.md) is loaded into your context as instructions on every chat run.\n- CLAUDE.md (next to this file) mirrors these instructions.\n\n\n## CLAUDE.md (embedded)\n\n# identity-check-agent — CLAUDE.md\n\nMirror of AGENTS.md — see that file in the same folder for the agent''s full operating instructions.\n\n## Identity\n\n- **Agent ID**: 186\n- **Workspace**: WORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_186\n\n## Quick reference\n\n- Workspace: `WORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_186`\n- User uploads (knowledge): `upload/`; deliverables: `generated/`; scratch/misc: `other/`; skills: `skills/`.\n- After producing a deliverable, summarize what you created and where it was saved.\n", "include_docker": false, "use_deepagents": true, "include_chat_ui": true, "interrupt_after": null, "interrupt_before": null, "reasoning_effort": "low", "use_local_sandbox": false, "skill_router_model": null, "use_phase9_graphindex": false, "disable_memory_middleware": false, "enable_compiled_subagents": true}', '[{"type": "filesystem", "enabled": true, "config": {}}]', '[]', '{"type": "state", "config": {}, "mappings": null}', '{"interrupts": {}, "token_limits": {"max_total_tokens": 100000, "eviction_threshold": 80000, "summarization_threshold": 60000}, "enable_auto_eviction": true, "enable_summarization": true, "long_term_memory": false}', '{}', 0, NULL, '1.0.0', TRUE, FALSE, '2026-08-17 08:53:41.016049+00:00', '2026-10-13 08:12:19.076329+00:00', 1
