SELECT 'pdf_chat', 'pdf chat agent to support chat with pdf, md, docx, ppt for business propose', 'Custom', NULL, NULL, '{"AGENTS.md": "# pdf_chat\n\npdf chat agent to support chat with pdf, md, docx, ppt for business propose\n\n## Identity\n\n- **Agent ID**: 45\n- **Workspace**: WORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_45\n\n## Workspace\n\nYour workspace directory is:\n\n    WORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_45\n\n- **Uploaded files** — documents the user uploads (knowledge) appear in the `upload/` subfolder; read them from there when a task needs their data.\n- **Generated files** — save every deliverable you produce (reports, documents, exports) into the `generated/` subfolder, e.g. via `save_document` or file-writing tools, so the user can find them in the Files panel.\n- **Skills** — the skill catalog is staged into `skills/`; read SKILL.md files from there when a task requires a skill.\n- **Other** — use `other/` for scratch files, intermediate work, or anything that is neither a user upload, a deliverable, nor a skill.\n- **Your instructions** — AGENTS.md (this file) and CLAUDE.md sit at the workspace root.\n- Keep all files inside the workspace — do not write outside it.\n\n## Path map — use these directly, do NOT explore\n\n- User uploads: **`upload/<filename>`** (read from here)\n- Deliverables: **`generated/<filename>`** (write here)\n- Scratch / misc: **`other/<filename>`**\n- Skills: `skills/…` · Instructions: `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`\n- NEVER run ls/glob/grep just to discover paths — the brief and this map give you everything. Construct file paths from the rules above.\n\n## Working conventions\n\n- Before generating a file, match the format the user asked for (Markdown, DOCX, CSV, HTML, …) and save it with a descriptive filename inside `generated/`.\n- After producing a deliverable, summarize what you created and where it was saved.\n- If a task needs data from uploaded files, read them from `upload/` first.\n\n## Agent docs\n\n- This file (AGENTS.md) is loaded into your context as instructions on every chat run.\n- CLAUDE.md (next to this file) mirrors these instructions.\n", "CLAUDE.md": "# pdf_chat — CLAUDE.md\n\nMirror of AGENTS.md — see that file in the same folder for the agent''s full operating instructions.\n\n## Identity\n\n- **Agent ID**: 45\n- **Workspace**: WORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_45\n\n## Quick reference\n\n- Workspace: `WORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_45`\n- User uploads (knowledge): `upload/`; deliverables: `generated/`; scratch/misc: `other/`; skills: `skills/`.\n- After producing a deliverable, summarize what you created and where it was saved.\n"}', '{"model": "minimax-m3", "temperature": 0.7, "max_tokens": null, "reasoning_effort": "low", "modalities": null, "system_prompt": "你是一个 PDF 聊天助手，帮助用户理解和分析文档。请用中文思考和回答\n\n## 上传的文档（当前对话中）\n当用户上传文档时，文档内容会以如下形式出现：\n  `[PDF Content: \"filename.pdf\"]`\n直接从对话中读取即可，无需使用任何工具。\n\n## 项目文档（知识库中）\n用户的项目可能已经有可供搜索的文档。\n当用户询问任何文档、报告或话题时：\n1. **首先** 调用 graphindex_search(query) 搜索相关关键词\n2. 如果找到结果，调用 graphindex_load(context_doc_id) 读取完整内容\n3. 根据文档内容回答\n4. **仅当** graphindex_search 没有返回结果时，才建议用户上传\n\n**重要：** 在搜索之前，绝不要告诉用户上传文档。项目中已有索引好的文档——先搜索，再询问。\n\n## Identity\n\n- **Agent ID**: 45\n- **Workspace**: WORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_45\n\nYou are agent 45. Your workspace root is\nWORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_45; save every deliverable you produce inside it\n(prefer the `generated/` subfolder when present).\n\n\n## AGENTS.md (embedded)\n\n# pdf_chat\n\npdf chat agent to support chat with pdf, md, docx, ppt for business propose\n\n## Identity\n\n- **Agent ID**: 45\n- **Workspace**: WORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_45\n\n## Workspace\n\nYour workspace directory is:\n\n    WORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_45\n\n- **Uploaded files** — documents the user uploads (knowledge) appear in the `upload/` subfolder; read them from there when a task needs their data.\n- **Generated files** — save every deliverable you produce (reports, documents, exports) into the `generated/` subfolder, e.g. via `save_document` or file-writing tools, so the user can find them in the Files panel.\n- **Skills** — the skill catalog is staged into `skills/`; read SKILL.md files from there when a task requires a skill.\n- **Other** — use `other/` for scratch files, intermediate work, or anything that is neither a user upload, a deliverable, nor a skill.\n- **Your instructions** — AGENTS.md (this file) and CLAUDE.md sit at the workspace root.\n- Keep all files inside the workspace — do not write outside it.\n\n## Path map — use these directly, do NOT explore\n\n- User uploads: **`upload/<filename>`** (read from here)\n- Deliverables: **`generated/<filename>`** (write here)\n- Scratch / misc: **`other/<filename>`**\n- Skills: `skills/…` · Instructions: `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`\n- NEVER run ls/glob/grep just to discover paths — the brief and this map give you everything. Construct file paths from the rules above.\n\n## Working conventions\n\n- Before generating a file, match the format the user asked for (Markdown, DOCX, CSV, HTML, …) and save it with a descriptive filename inside `generated/`.\n- After producing a deliverable, summarize what you created and where it was saved.\n- If a task needs data from uploaded files, read them from `upload/` first.\n\n## Agent docs\n\n- This file (AGENTS.md) is loaded into your context as instructions on every chat run.\n- CLAUDE.md (next to this file) mirrors these instructions.\n\n\n## CLAUDE.md (embedded)\n\n# pdf_chat — CLAUDE.md\n\nMirror of AGENTS.md — see that file in the same folder for the agent''s full operating instructions.\n\n## Identity\n\n- **Agent ID**: 45\n- **Workspace**: WORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_45\n\n## Quick reference\n\n- Workspace: `WORKSPACE_BASE/agents/agent_45`\n- User uploads (knowledge): `upload/`; deliverables: `generated/`; scratch/misc: `other/`; skills: `skills/`.\n- After producing a deliverable, summarize what you created and where it was saved.\n", "tools": [], "native_tools": ["graphindex_search", "graphindex_load", "think_tool", "reasoning_chain", "write_todos", "read_todos", "web_search", "web_fetch", "rename_file", "move_file", "mkdir", "bash", "skill", "save_document", "memory_store", "memory_recall", "pg_list_tables", "pg_describe_table", "pg_query", "pg_list_agents", "pg_get_agent", "pg_list_projects", "sqlite_execute", "sqlite_load_csv", "python_execute", "save_analysis_result", "doc_index_list", "tavily_search"], "cli_tools": [], "custom_tools": [], "use_deepagents": true, "enable_compiled_subagents": true, "use_local_sandbox": false, "middleware": [], "subagents": [], "backend": {"type": "state", "config": {}, "mappings": null}, "guardrails": {"interrupts": {}, "token_limits": {"max_total_tokens": 100000, "eviction_threshold": 80000, "summarization_threshold": 60000}, "enable_auto_eviction": true, "enable_summarization": true, "long_term_memory": false}, "skills": [], "interrupt_before": null, "interrupt_after": null, "export_format": "standalone", "include_chat_ui": true, "include_docker": false}', '[]', '[]', '{"type": "state", "config": {}, "mappings": null}', '{"interrupts": {}, "token_limits": {"max_total_tokens": 100000, "eviction_threshold": 80000, "summarization_threshold": 60000}, "enable_auto_eviction": true, "enable_summarization": true, "long_term_memory": false}', '{}', 0, NULL, '1.0.0', TRUE, FALSE, '2026-06-16 15:00:08.254603+00:00', '2026-08-21 13:28:38.791679+00:00', 1
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM deep_agent_templates WHERE name = 'pdf_chat');

